{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1538,
  "batch_count": 1711,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d25ece0757aaa73613c5e413f9fcfb8770c034dd",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b59fd18a9dd672f3301668c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…………。\r\n……不。只是觉得\r\n你现在，也在我身边。",
      "source_fingerprint": "454d61c3620c60acbaf004fa3e933454f84637be73797656d05d84a3cc24af48",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b6f935a6b1f6c93aa70011b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "擅长速度的、擅长技巧的……\r\n家族中最强的最强会在\r\n新年决定。在板羽球大赛上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b3b879690d990a37ee0b7e2195a5786c31b11f0d8384d4b9077ed1ae7476dab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4acec417db119ee5b4d80adf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我给送我巧克力的人回赠大豆饼干。\r\n同时摄取豆类中的维生素E，\r\n效果会更好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f66041f38321b8d7efab0b99279775322dc497666961e8119207cff171d73a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94bcfdcead0de451cb61acd9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我准备了可可含量70％的巧克力。\r\n虽然苦味较重，\r\n但抗氧化作用很好。……辛苦了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "81b1c8fc4c53135e1416d3620a3c8ec6bee1c6b5f1f6cb676d33f6e527f5c3ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d97d13a3f6e5f24b10e09d4e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每年，我都会在许愿笺上祈愿家族\r\n健康平安。\r\n……只要能实现，就足够了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0c6897d89d3b7e4b4b35d40df8e76313250cf6d276784ca1ea7247e0b5ba38b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f82f4b54b6a82590b471dae9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果，灵魂真的\r\n存在……我想邀请过去伟大的\r\n赛马娘，一起并跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d740e357b5be8c44b97e2057a03b0d7f37bf3206a4cf35e7955176da23f004c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:692d17dbbaca119017ba4d63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们全家把圣诞节定为饮食放纵日。\r\n禁止计算蛋糕的热量。\r\n父母也会笑着阻止我",
      "source_fingerprint": "10e927baddfb78df598ea4d940e54bd7edd7b232e89edf1977060b4e1e39ec87",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98fa9727d003f82881713c62",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "稍微，出去走走如何？……听说巴黎的\r\n大街也十分华丽。\r\n今天似乎能，感受到那样的氛围",
      "source_fingerprint": "bac9955103130f1d39eb7fcf3d01f097b0f98abb60909d4468ae99e360c8422e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf92984564d7b2f45b3cd3e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "理所当然的结果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "40e949f5a51abdea07d1f36453852492c5e1dcf81dc08d8f70cb0826e984f694",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c0fb5194f4e7f8cdfe46345",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说年末年初很容易长胖。\r\n我想了些简单的运动。你的目标\r\n是消耗2000千卡。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3414d82e01cfb8418bbffb3607b265880beee4b47d748f62a7a3e4819ee290a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6c615a48277994691a6bf7d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你，今天过生日吧。生日快乐。\r\n我准备了亲戚经营的健身房邀请券。\r\n这次由我来担任训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "08406cb513d0522204999832eff767ef9b8f1569b643009b9462b2637438deca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90032106b99119e5fbf6b7ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……说实话，我很少给别人送礼物\r\n所以有些苦恼。\r\n怎样做，你才会高兴？",
      "source_fingerprint": "95dffd621c6f83a8ab06d734aff970fc62ab83516481e89ec57dac986232a3fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2603c8ba73dec958d7f31e8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐姐们寄来了礼物。\r\n以王冠为主题的，钢笔和手套……\r\n我要注意做出与之相称的举止。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb12747cf146d60cad1c0aa6ebf3d57a18976e70611a0431caff243736da7ed0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a6e3d4ac43f580458d63160",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想要的东西……能占用你的时间\r\n吗。我想为今后的典礼\r\n……订做一套，与你相配的衣装。",
      "source_fingerprint": "28dc1d5194edbed9235a753df212e15fe4191a34cf8f35b2a73ed78e0af23378",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce7cbf91f6d9f3f6ee7ae63a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有通知。\r\n最好尽早确认。",
      "source_fingerprint": "226e530c44f05ceb5de3fcbe6b6fbebdb94de9a397b9480bebb98eb8c6bbc9a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7277a0269b76c570bb8d413",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到了给你的礼物。\r\n建议你领取。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1adfe3168b370c7c6a2db9838c4bf29bc5af4261f926541a57666581fe3e62f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de816d66b158031f3326f240",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有已经完成的任务。\r\n自己达成的成果，应该\r\n准确掌握。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c63a34e2384ad6c233a4dce6d8665cd47ffa303326de5cff6bb2bb1af4c5854",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52c89b2c7aba30d31ae21230",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "似乎有活动。\r\n我认为可以考虑参加。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d060b8c4680fa743e17f6b147d82904013e30ffa0dda0e59b4080e683efff84",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a578bf6096d8d6d92e37a608",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动正在举办。\r\n去活动现场，露个面\r\n也不错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ade37819a4483dde91adb8f74494c30836c4f7b656707e3a4df591ed12374ced",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c2470f3a47268eee7301acc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……吸取教训吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9903eadb6fbc5c5b04631736a7ca392e18b019fbc9609b7d0744ec74b16aa814",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc1560ebf46304575c8c9f72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名册等级似乎提高了。\r\n最好准确掌握自己的成果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a2213317492d9770985e82addabd2c4bd254b0a98cd3f4bf5476980c95157d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40f67c5dba196671abb121c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的私服多是运动品牌的，因为弹性\n和速干性都很好，可以直接进行\n一些简单的训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "38cf81061ca7f01b4066f5ddd687a24548d8fa91e7d89190b029b9caf929891a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e70f18eab65100368518af84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论什么时候、在任何情况下，\n我都不会失去仪态。我一直注意\n让自己在别人眼中也无可羞愧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "90383046fbfafe6bc6e85a24018f63fff773dc1e369f7cbf4b44e5d5a73becbc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1eb429ac61a00f98d509d73a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "气槽姐曾经教过我化妆……  \n在她帮我上红色眼影的时候，\n我非常紧张。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9114e8b2d9e14d34d5590626308ac0e6f8752a61a800b930e60523adc6633e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c41e5d48a2c37438e2e25da5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "实力相当，吗――",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a01768081954aa115e2a0112491470a7b4a9ad55c752a6c619743c32bf16a9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f746f721fa34ad355145035",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正因为是最强。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7fc130417ce0ad5a38cc3ab6be09ca7338488b4199fff2e4b36133bf3f69027",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f56e037b1985f66ebc4088e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……吸取教训吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9903eadb6fbc5c5b04631736a7ca392e18b019fbc9609b7d0744ec74b16aa814",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1c392f3971d49dce4f5fd93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "实力相当，吗――",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a01768081954aa115e2a0112491470a7b4a9ad55c752a6c619743c32bf16a9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20eb7eda6111a45895b59a51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最高分刷新了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcbd654253cda31579be70bdc2b04abee0d1e8f168c2ceb27d3c6da06d45bb6b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35d4726f81713ef8191f0095",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "狂野地，前进――",
      "source_fingerprint": "89db2fb30b6bbc2ced11a77be8876453c006df809085aeb26bca93a3d2563269",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d2fa40a584400f65f9764f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be4a92dcb582f2dfde4c8841",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练吗？\r\n好，先仔细准备吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cbe05855f3f7c95b5a099200e998b8bc958d8d6d9b10b8afb7fe36b6973a31d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58618fcdad115702c9bc9d5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "过去的荣耀，故事――\r\n我想成为有资格继承它们的自己。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c3e678d9d5798ec86eb1513be06319b41faec32bd2154be437f4b0a74bee034",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4e10e74b94c22727d535787",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要报名比赛吗。\r\n试试――平日锻炼的成果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6928a556d97af9d6cdb263117f4d78b4d69805168d44bcf96b67837d746ed486",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cec94ff4a8f4ad354564c24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最强的――",
      "source_fingerprint": "0367503e517de5ef4ab3290121cc093a038be4b190e2ab5f9461723f2af12312",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "1195"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6c3e73587ff18c2604a0430",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "与“女帝”同行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d15ca61c3b4201614bf67b0db8bf7435772454b72ce4d84e31ac74ed949f2f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "1196"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f95a86c91e6bf45b5de02d00",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘 Pretty Derby！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c68d1ccbe412517d037eba3349a53caf52ee4216f3314987c5d59645520f8f8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccae1722eb3d2fa59922debf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是，继承而来的力量――",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7f6f1cb0e6ddc9c2ed46814d085ea5bbfae0d2809d25d3326f871ed6612c96e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88ca6c5bddb2549ff5275160",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是今天的登录奖励。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cc7b99b32d8f34da6bd620973df2ae9a0a57751a69db6f6dffcae6088fc7c17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:174017ea6c9d53549b07e48f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5340d32cafefeb07fb71f273be0d9e41c17a0c3f97ce3ec0784aa70ad39fd299",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfab802454aa20857976c2ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f93d3b7ef27d7cc0857d72ec2a4909bbb86efae229156b450540a7bebfc972c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03350cc85e13b1c4c0c77217",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "533af1ec55aaabd2fb64979f1b375b53b2aa3d91c5132bfaaf1eceef39f399ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:852d4b1af970d3ea014a557b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这么多……！真是出色的专注力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5a198e3ea7de6a4acf83da8ae396c6718ecae4330e5efda90578913271cc3c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f27917c2ba06d6238f1efa8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……真可爱。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29653d0dac00d4197471f9b6a3276198c62a212e79bdf213d02578c7a819d572",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9f0936f841fc45e73186b53",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……用到下次吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ef78ed4b9553017b32da676571637bbd2f3bec8085bcb54b9a94542c956f66b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0a922567d9bc413fd256196",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这么多……！真是出色的专注力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5a198e3ea7de6a4acf83da8ae396c6718ecae4330e5efda90578913271cc3c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:923f6ded15891544b437b7bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……真可爱。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29653d0dac00d4197471f9b6a3276198c62a212e79bdf213d02578c7a819d572",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5de2e2c376074fcbfb8493df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "146069b643c6668acc74944c0a932644d0aaa363332a146c873f12a15bd68de7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa2451d8c42e75d01ad4b509",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bd7674ae15dc5c25811d101fc522c48bef95dcff5df37c8affcde958805dcdc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c66507daa5983421541069ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "集中。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b65bda3e4804f46ed70197c5ef2281d1e5ad51cbe99f4b35590bcdbd0698abc1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f288452d5e314c0732dc41eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "连在一起……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "77d3fac527939fe0d8a576401a95b5e9e735e97b054d97d2f2f3852c5509fd3c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbb551265c75866e57f50702",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成功了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a45daa99d47f792f2e008a4d0f0b1b9ac1f29d1a3b8800e80d5d08a8e678d39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7531de37178e1b35198065eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就这样……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c107239d46d94844e729b0f9db5541e4dda7f29df7594f043462707cc931fba5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a7f779f038658f959666cf5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e34abed1ddb126fde54bfedaf035b92aac16d1e143243cc656102c6ded090c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0908484ded49187581c3225f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f81d129916de8c3ba2ae94389e277a5e59ddda1de2c5af0e0d67323fb5a78727",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3398021a7d95930f579cfa9a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不玩吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc304fadcd6becac564f5785fce2864eba507fa5d1be809a2a506cafaae0909b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4474a56e5e6b8f29b9c80773",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e25fbfb5adf006063d769535cca5c4bf887ead87e21d1fb7929b3b1028061378",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b07a34857c2e951bec410e76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "30e2d95119bde6568d56818441797a798cd7d8143a5690f18751dd3be7ad0628",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36093af121fadc08b6f408ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天似乎是这个。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fed1e5dc328f84eeb3cea132edfbdad24cc0dcd3a4c4dbe62ed02381a47b07e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcba7ff2c3287533b828c4a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我建议休息。这样下去，\r\n会影响训练表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "75feeb7c7009a6bf4500d7979e8b38e31f4bc887db6885441f2b9bbfa23787bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54e9d16ed12ea79deb8d6817",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……以现在的状态继续训练，\n难以期待成果。\n最好先调整一次。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ceb3398ab010358a1ed454b316d2ef64058a91336cd8c6049e1773d0b9eeb6c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f281aee8a1dd8b497b0e575e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……所有感觉都协调一致。\r\n即使比平时更艰苦的训练\r\n也能顺利完成。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2140c2fca29f34206e0f30060919b8f598fdd113eb835b2d394ca5d1621245d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:909dba1bd3b904cb017bec01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了达到与那些光辉璀璨，名留历史的\r\n先辈相同――不，\r\n更高的境界……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "35688383131f3eaaeda4d1b22222c83dd288eeb9e0a01cb8122933308ea5f251",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f881cc73211ac8d4e542b8b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想稍微改变一下跑位路线。\r\n开始冲刺的位置也一样――\r\n想要，彻底找出最优解。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf6022ea8834c724d5ccd75eee6c8631bb01e681b7d898af3b44ab1ee87d144d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1abf578240a1ccd133d052d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了以最强之姿君临\r\n――开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a9423f4ef03bb19e0e065742be12c58b25f20b575e37248c35a7e37acaecfcf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bf720032eeaa0fe8638d610",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "始终，做该做的事。\r\n父亲也，祖父也。都是靠不懈努力\r\n留下了前无古人的成绩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "be647f5681dd0e745a90d1400f7803a0389053dac22223639c5e7de1a52de981",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e16c88884916d02053b247a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既不狂躁，也不一味沉静\r\n――只是，做该做的事",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe290da575e3b765df6cb884e57176afdccce4f9bbbbc00dd65bc2fa12beff10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ea07a85cd6d0834ecff4e1c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼……，不必在意。\r\n我刚才在冥想……。\r\n稍微，有些杂念。",
      "source_fingerprint": "295d55fd930986c5d93f5af994b8cdb3792e0d4c5189734fe3922610eb91f9ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a174c9de9b1d5519837cc129",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听节奏快的歌曲，\r\n能让我做好训练前的心理准备。\r\n……不过，感觉不到效果……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f586e01c287f68508534d12b2a5692918c5ed12eeb92943b48e3858a09307ca5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1bba2061d7bcf9da8e41fa43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……别被其他事物分心。\r\n集中精神……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "820add72587f09444dedae49e41fe8f48ddb3f957856deeae6bbb53887079315",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9458bed534f907a209841b12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "抱歉，我马上准备……\r\n……呼，吸……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d35d4aa702e073a1c9d7a02eeab6407be21e7b58e59c93ba9eae93693f244a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfc0273afd83d6aed1960a2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……最近连续参赛。\r\n腿和精神都会承受负担……\r\n之后的调整会不会需要很长时间",
      "source_fingerprint": "e38a13aa68b5806121e4116c2250bec8a3a59a1755bf1bf8c64e96321b04259f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03d8377bc383c5303c953a62",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……积累的疲劳和参赛带来的\r\n风险，已经不容忽视。\r\n虽然危险……真的，要挑战吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f32fd401e82918443ac4099678d26fc3769e3870967996c53a2ab0778458e44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f662fd0f11ebee760ce3ccb4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "双腿轻盈，心率也无可挑剔……\r\n这样的话，应该能发挥出\r\n最佳表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "99336377d801f90f871a256628cb6cc933f3d149f5c65a5107cfc718c295e666",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ecc0f16d7e36f9d789ea7340",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可以说状态，无限接近理想。\r\n――我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "56a391a2bf543047fd37c9a3aa2a647a5c2eb5ade2b406faecd8b6fd01a60dc7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae904fb0fc72eef13afd3463",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "狂野地，激烈地――\r\n随着高昂的心跳，出发。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da5857acc5e53bccde2da78049b674e2bb48a64bd2b9b0b0ed2319e964c50ffb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5ce85fb9526fe3a1f2b2137",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "调整得很好。接下来，\r\n只需相信这血脉中蕴藏的力量……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "12698dc554ebae4d1a5185d72946582e183381b061290561dc8b3836a465e389",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:856a88effbb9cc02b9cd017c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用成绩证明，“最强”――\r\n证明名为我的，结晶。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aebf2a28f1ef231d61ed4c96d860f4935a9aff85f80f285c76d96ae9eb440d09",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53ffaaa436e1405b3bad7f06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "作为家族的一员，\r\n交出足以自豪的成绩。\r\n向这沸腾的，血脉起誓――",
      "source_fingerprint": "8279736709c7ad474f9424e7c12b3598ba27049f38ca4e864f0efe5d961f3783",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9626f478ce690f57d4811197",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态不好，也不坏――\r\n但，最强必须始终如一。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f747967d479a7c7c8bf9ea687d6bb31b0d2c2bd53fa5c1c5bb3bafdbdbe2528e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20029"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
